    "summary": "The framework/application split: framework/ and app/ become independent sibling folders with separate PSR-4 namespace roots (Frank\\/App\\), each replaceable/preserved independently on update. Every framework class renamed App\\ -> Frank\\. Several real bugs fixed along the way (schema-path resolution, double database seeding, an infinite redirect loop on forbidden tenant-settings access, hardcoded BitFitter branding in a framework default). Container and Router gained override() for deliberate replacement and now throw on accidental duplicate registration. Framework email templates became per-application overridable via config('mail.templates'). One broken, unused feature (cron_task_reminders.php) removed outright. Full detail in CHANGELOG.md [2.0.0].",
